    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What would you do if the one you love the most suddenly disappeared? <br>How far would you be willing to go to save her? <br>What would be your limit?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disappeared is a horror game, in a semi-open world, based on exploration and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wife disappears in the middle of a camp. You need to understand what is happening, and find a way to save her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNEXPLAINED EVENTS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Semi-open world, you are free to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange and mysterious day and night cycle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time anomalies disturb the natural cycle of the hours. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variable climates and environments: rain, storms, fog, and several other supernatural climate changes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/e21f062d0e8a24ef68f779f55543ed7e.poster.avif?t=1752681631\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/e21f062d0e8a24ef68f779f55543ed7e.webm?t=1752681631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/e21f062d0e8a24ef68f779f55543ed7e.mp4?t=1752681631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A RICH STORY DRIVES THE EVENTS</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A plot explains the game facts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A balanced story, without too much verbosity (long texts).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will not be 'led by hand' and will have to read between the lines to understand the game's lore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/0d1eb7f3f5bae9ba521aaba91036b1e5.poster.avif?t=1752681631\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/0d1eb7f3f5bae9ba521aaba91036b1e5.webm?t=1752681631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/0d1eb7f3f5bae9ba521aaba91036b1e5.mp4?t=1752681631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND INVESTIGATE</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clues will make you progress in solving the mysteries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find passages of history that will gradually help you understand the plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find various objects, each one with its role in the game's progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Central puzzles that will unlock the regions of the semi-open world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/93692f90e0c8f78dfe19cc8ac5abe36b.poster.avif?t=1752681631\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/93692f90e0c8f78dfe19cc8ac5abe36b.webm?t=1752681631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/93692f90e0c8f78dfe19cc8ac5abe36b.mp4?t=1752681631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TENSION AND ENEMIES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be in a classic horror environment, full of psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are powerful. Avoiding them is the best way to proceed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are limited ways to face enemies, but the necessary resources are scarce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemies react to you: some can see you; others can hear you; others can sense your presence at a certain\u00a0distance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/0c56be0de793232cc69abbdf6e14cd04.poster.avif?t=1752681631\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/0c56be0de793232cc69abbdf6e14cd04.webm?t=1752681631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/0c56be0de793232cc69abbdf6e14cd04.mp4?t=1752681631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
