ill be in a classic horror environment, full of psychological tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies are powerful. Avoiding them is the best way to proceed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are limited ways to face enemies, but the necessary resources are scarce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemies react to you: some can see you; others can hear you; others can sense your presence at a certain\u00a0distance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/0c56be0de793232cc69abbdf6e14cd04.poster.avif?t=1752681631\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/0c56be0de793232cc69abbdf6e14cd04.webm?t=1752681631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471850/extras/0c56be0de793232cc69abbdf6e14cd04.mp4?t=1752681631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
